Package: surveyup
Title: Weighted Survey Analysis Assistance
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bridget", "Mayrer", , "bmm146@pitt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package extends the `survey` R package for analyzing survey data from NHANES and NAMCS. 
    `surveyup` provides functions to load, merge, and manipulate NHANES and NAMCS datasets with ease, 
    supporting weighted analysis for survey design objects.
